//
//    Loop - IsCompletePrefix + CloseConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, |generated| += 1 (">>").
//    Delta equal, bound preserved.
//
//    Loop - ConfidenceGatedStep + AppendConstrainedToken (non-EOS): steps += 1,
//    |generated| += 1 (one token appended). Delta equal, bound preserved.
//
//    Loop - ConfidenceGatedStep returning EOS: steps += 1, |generated| unchanged.
//    |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + (steps-1) + 1 = |generatedPrefix| + steps. Preserved.
//
//    Post-loop RollbackConstrainedToComplete: +0 cost, may shrink |generated|.
//    CloseConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, |generated| increases by at most 1 (">>").
//    Since we're post-loop and only execute when steps < maxSteps, bound preserved.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

