//
// For the 57% baseline attempt, the 40 semantic mismatches show the model
// generates overly complex queries. The model tends to:
// 1. Generate unnecessary JOINs
// 2. Miss WHERE clauses
// 3. Use wrong column names
//
// The best guidance we've found is "Write a concise, correct SQL query. Use 
// only the tables and columns from the schema. Output the query directly without
